					Hdt.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.122
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				725
			</span></i> (Milet.), <i><span class="en">
				Eus.Mynd.
